# This is a snap PACKAGING repo. Upstream Actual source is cloned in here so
# snap-analyzer can scan it, but is never committed — snapcraft.yaml builds
# from source: + source-tag.
#
# Strategy: ignore everything, then re-include only the packaging files.

/*
/.*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/snap/
!/SNAP_PACKAGING.md
!/SNAP-PROGRESS.md

# Build artefacts stay ignored even though snap/ is re-included
*.snap
